WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:09.591
A collapsed conversation could hide a question on a demo handover. The orange dot now marks it, and hovering explains that the agent has a question.

00:00:10.546 --> 00:00:18.906
Ideas get the same cue. Opening the conversation reveals the pending question, and removes the dot while the conversation is visible.

00:00:21.032 --> 00:00:28.672
Proposals also show the dot when they have an open question. The tooltip and the screen reader label give the same explanation.

00:00:29.627 --> 00:00:36.227
A task with a result and a question keeps the cue too. It works across every card with a collapsible conversation.

00:00:37.179 --> 00:00:44.419
In dark mode, the dot uses the same waiting color as the rest of the interface. The question cue now follows the theme.

00:00:45.372 --> 00:00:52.932
A card without an open question has the normal Show conversation button. The cue appears only where a question needs attention.
